    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n4 Bedroom Semi Detached house of c. 121.16 sqm. just off the Park Road on the edge of Longford town centre.\n\nEntering the house at the side there is a bright sitting room with an open fireplace. Looking out onto the front of the house is the kitchen / dining area with built in units and dual aspect windows. This area is south east facing so is bright throughout the day. There is a ground floor bedroom and shower room on this level.\n\nOn the first floor the main bedroom has an ensuite shower room. There are two further bedrooms, one of which is double sized. The single bedroom is still a decent size and would be an ideal home office to take advantage of the fibre to the home broadband available in the area. There is also a semi tiled bathroom. \n\nThe house has been recently repainted and is presented in good condition. This house is an ideal first home or investment property.\n\n\nServices\n• Mains Water and Sewerage, \n• Oil fired central heating\n• Fibre to the home broadband available.\n\n\nOutside :\nTo the rear of the house there is a walled in concrete yard area with a fuel shed. To the front there is a lawn and a driveway with parking space for a number of cars. \n\n\nLocation:\nLocated off the Park Road, Legion terrace is within easy walking distance of the town centre and the Train Station. As well as being beside the Royal Canal the house is also beside the old greyhound track, where there are plans to develop a public park and playing fields.\n\nEircode: N39 A0H9 \nGPS: 53.7221, -7.79458"
      },
      {
